          "content": "我将结合供应商表结构和融资提示需求，设计一个综合解决方案。以下是实现方案：\n\n1. 首先创建供应商表（包含提示相关字段）：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE `supplier_prompt_settings` (\n  `id` bigint NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT COMMENT '主键ID',\n  `supplier_code` varchar(32) NOT NULL COMMENT '供应商编码(唯一)',\n  `never_show_prompt` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0' COMMENT '永久不提示(1:是,0:否)',\n  `last_prompt_close` date DEFAULT NULL COMMENT '最后关闭日期',\n  `create_time` datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '创建时间',\n  `update_time` datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP ON UPDATE CURRENT_TIMESTAMP COMMENT '更新时间',\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `uk_supplier_code` (`supplier_code`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4 COMMENT='供应商提示设置表';\n```\n\n2. Java实体类：\n\n```java\n@Entity\n@Table(name = \"supplier_prompt_settings\")\n@Getter\n@Setter\n@NoArgsConstructor\npublic class SupplierPromptSetting {\n    @Id\n    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)\n    private Long id;\n    \n    @Column(name = \"supplier_code\", nullable = false, unique = true)\n    private String supplierCode;\n    \n    @Column(name = \"never_show_prompt\", nullable = false)\n    private boolean neverShowPrompt = false;\n    \n    @Column(name = \"last_prompt_close\")\n    private LocalDate lastPromptClose;\n    \n    // 其他供应商字段...\n}\n```\n\n3. 服务层实现：\n\n```java\n@Service\n@RequiredArgsConstructor\npublic class SupplierPromptService {\n    private final SupplierPromptRepository promptRepository;\n\n    public boolean shouldShowPrompt(String supplierCode) {\n        SupplierPromptSetting setting = promptRepository.findBySupplierCode(supplierCode);\n        if (setting == null) return true;\n        if (setting.isNeverShowPrompt()) return false;\n        return !LocalDate.now().equals(setting.getLastPromptClose());\n    }\n\n    public void disablePromptPermanently(String supplierCode) {\n        SupplierPromptSetting setting = getOrCreateSetting(supplierCode);\n        setting.setNeverShowPrompt(true);\n        promptRepository.save(setting);\n    }\n\n    public void closePromptForToday(String supplierCode) {\n        SupplierPromptSetting setting = getOrCreateSetting(supplierCode);\n        setting.setLastPromptClose(LocalDate.now());\n        promptRepository.save(setting);\n    }\n\n    private SupplierPromptSetting getOrCreateSetting(String supplierCode) {\n        SupplierPromptSetting setting = promptRepository.findBySupplierCode(supplierCode);\n        return setting != null ? setting : new SupplierPromptSetting(supplierCode);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n4. 控制器：\n\n```java\n@RestController\n@RequestMapping(\"/api/supplier/prompt\")\n@RequiredArgsConstructor\npublic class SupplierPromptController {\n    private final SupplierPromptService promptService;\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/status/{supplierCode}\")\n    public boolean checkPromptStatus(@PathVariable String supplierCode) {\n        return promptService.shouldShowPrompt(supplierCode);\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/disable/{supplierCode}\")\n    public void disablePrompt(@PathVariable String supplierCode) {\n        promptService.disablePromptPermanently(supplierCode);\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/close/{supplierCode}\")\n    public void closePrompt(@PathVariable String supplierCode) {\n        promptService.closePromptForToday(supplierCode);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n这个设计：\n1. 使用供应商编码作为唯一标识\n2. 同时满足供应商管理和提示控制需求\n3. 提供完整的API接口\n4. 优化了供应商编码查询性能\n\n需要我将这些实现到具体文件中吗？请提供文件路径。",
